{
  "_comment": "Copy this file to personal.json (which is gitignored) and fill in real data. The CV/søknad builders read personal.json. Only facts you actually have — leave a field as an empty string or empty list if you don't want it shown; the builder omits empty sections rather than printing a placeholder. photo_path is relative to the repo root; leave empty to render the plain two-line header with no photo/table layout. hobbies_no is the Norwegian-language CV's hobbies list — falls back to hobbies (untranslated) if omitted. home_latitude/home_longitude feed reachability.py's public-transport travel-time badge — omit them and it falls back to Oslo (harmless, just makes every badge read like a long trip).",
